Close as "Not A Bug". The https://github.com/awslabs/amazon-ecr-credential-helper needs "auths" in .docker/config.json too when docker build trying to pull the FROM image. 
As long as we keep "auths" in .docker/config.json, both mesos agent and ECR will be fine.

