Master master@17.174.144.199:5050 refused authentication
{noformat}

Note the lack of log metadata on the exit message. This message (from {{slave.cpp}} and a number of others in the same file should all use {{LOG(FATAL)}} so that log aggregation can pick up the timestamp, error severity, etc.

