Subscribed with ID dc2b3db0-953c-47a4-8fd4-f6d040e9d10e-0002
Submitted task 'test1' to agent 'dc2b3db0-953c-47a4-8fd4-f6d040e9d10e-S0'
Received status update TASK_STARTING for task 'test1'
