 },
 "dns": {}

}

 

I'm not sure what the aim of this file is, but eth0 is definitely not correct here, as the machine is using bonding, the correct interface is bond0...

Thats the IP configuration of your running mesos tasks. Thats why eth0 should be ok because it is the interface inside of your mesos tasks sandbox.

 

